# Type alias accessible across document scope chain.
# [Coord: [type [x: Integer  y: Integer]]] defines a coordinate type alias.
# In the next expression, @Coord is used to annotate a dict.
[Coord: [type [x: Integer  y: Integer]]]
[p: [@Coord [x: 1  y: 2]]]
=== out
Dict({"p": Dict({"x": Int(1), "y": Int(2)})})
